### 10. 사전 상태 준비: Cart에 quantity=4
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/carts/items
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"projectId": {{projectId}}, "items": [{"rewardId": {{rewardId}}, "quantity": 4}]}

> {% client.test("4개 담기 성공", function() { client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body); }); %}

### 11. POST quantity=2 → 기존 4 + 요청 2 = 6 > 재고 5, 409로 거부되고 수량은 4 유지
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/carts/items
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"projectId": {{projectId}}, "items": [{"rewardId": {{rewardId}}, "quantity": 2}]}

> {%
    client.test("POST 4+2=6 > 재고5 → 409", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 409, "expected 409, got " + response.status + ": " + response.body);
    });
%}

### 12. Cart는 여전히 quantity=4 여야 한다
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/carts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
    client.test("거부 후 quantity=4 유지", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body);
        const r = response.body.data.projects[0].rewards.find(x => String(x.rewardId) === String(client.global.get("rewardId")));
        client.assert(r.quantity === 4, "expected quantity to stay 4, got " + r.quantity);
    });
%}

### 13. PATCH quantity=5 → 요청값 자체가 재고(5)와 같으므로 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/carts/items
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"projectId": {{projectId}}, "items": [{"rewardId": {{rewardId}}, "quantity": 5}]}

> {%
    client.test("PATCH 5 == 재고5 → 200", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "expected 200, got " + response.status + ": " + response.body);
        const r = response.body.data.projects[0].rewards.find(x => String(x.rewardId) === String(client.global.get("rewardId")));
        client.assert(r.quantity === 5, "expected quantity 5, got " + r.quantity);
    });
%}

### 14. PATCH quantity=6 → 재고(5) 초과, 409로 거부되고 수량은 5 유지
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/carts/items
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"projectId": {{projectId}}, "items": [{"rewardId": {{rewardId}}, "quantity": 6}]}

> {%
    client.test("PATCH 6 > 재고5 → 409", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 409, "expected 409, got " + response.status + ": " + response.body);
    });
%}

### 15. 최종적으로 quantity=5 유지, Reward 재고 자체는 변경되지 않아야 한다
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/carts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
    client.test("최종 quantity=5 유지", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body);
        const r = response.body.data.projects[0].rewards.find(x => String(x.rewardId) === String(client.global.get("rewardId")));
        client.assert(r.quantity === 5, "expected quantity to stay 5, got " + r.quantity);
    });
%}

### 16. Reward 자체의 remainingQuantity는 Cart 작업으로 변경되지 않아야 한다 (여전히 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rewards/{{rewardId}}

> {%
    client.test("remainingQuantity는 Cart 작업으로 변경되지 않음", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body);
        client.assert(response.body.data.remainingQuantity === 5, "expected remainingQuantity to stay 5, got " + response.body.data.remainingQuantity);
    });
%}
